<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese police seize 600 kg of cocaine.</title>
<headline>Portuguese police seize 600 kg of cocaine.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese police have seized 600 kg (1,320 lbs) of cocaine, one of the largest hauls ever in the country, and arrested four suspected traffickers, a spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>Two Portuguese and two Spaniards were arrested in the raid in the northern Portuguese city of Braga, the spokesman said.</p>
